The '''Chess Event''' is the fifth boss of [[Tower of Karazhan]]. The pieces are:

* The [[King]] and [[Queen]];
* The [[Rook]] and [[Broken Rook]];
* The [[Knight]] and [[Malfunctioning Knight]];
* The [[Bishop]] and [[Decaying Bishop]];
* The [[Withering Pawn]]s.

